The '''Pocket Monsters Music Festival''' (Japanese: '''アニメポケットモンスター{{tt|音楽祭|おんがくさい}}''' ''Anime {{tt|Pocket Monsters|Pokémon}} Music Festival'') is a one-hour [[List of animated series specials|special]] that aired in Japan on March 31, 2023, two weeks before the premiere of ''[[Pokémon Horizons: The Series]]''.

It featured various artists performing theme songs from the [[Pokémon animated series]], including [[Heart-Pounding Diary]], the first opening theme of ''Pokémon Horizons: The Series''.

